TITLE Add sulfuric acid in steps to pure water at pH 7.0
# Using a single REACTION block with multiple steps

SOLUTION 1
    pH 7.0
    temp 25
    units mol/L

REACTION 1
    H2SO4  1
    0.001  0.005  0.01  0.05  0.1  moles

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected_output2.txt
    -reset false
    -step
    -si H2(g)

END
